+  static String? tryAppDir(String id) =>
+      isResolvableId(id) ? '$root/$id' : null;
+
+  /// Resolves a file under `apps/<id>/`. [relative] may carry
+  /// subdirectories (`game/main.js`); every segment is validated, so the
